Package: duxdm
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Robert Põldmaa <c4mandry@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libpam0g
Recommends: xinit
Description: simple, fast TUI display manager for the Linux console
 duxdm is a getty-like display manager: type a username and password,
 then pick a desktop environment or window manager from a menu.
 Wayland sessions are started directly on the current VT; X11 sessions
 go through xinit. No GUI toolkit, no config files — just a fast,
 dependency-light console login.
